    exact (reciprocal_one_sub_norm_le (beta i) delta hdelta (hsep i).le).trans (le_max_right _ _)
  · intro K k hk hkK
    simpa only [mul_div_cancel_left₀ M (Nat.cast_ne_zero.mpr hn.ne')] using
